==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-go against the grain.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|[[go]]<goes,,went,gone> [[against the grain]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[defy]] [[convention]]; to do something in a manner that is [[unusual]] or [[out of the ordinary]].
#: {{ux|en|His method certainly '''goes against the grain''', but it is unquestionably effective.}}

